.worktrees/
.superpowers/
# Docker Desktop can misfire its WSL disk-image-location setting to a
# relative path that resolves against this repo's directory — defensive
# ignore so a stray multi-GB VHDX can never be accidentally committed.
DockerDesktopWSL/
